 "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=txtFNiG8c_kQ7kNvwHKKKaV&_nc_oc=Adl39lDXZa7j7NPaBdEphE7MmDgKaaq1Xs1EUXn46onTUo7nk1efAWXwbPJgG8hS6c0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afwpbwa35m4J1Q0KQZxj1Leia90q-39_palKHsmmrsHQhQ&oe=69B93639"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_ZxmxJdq_OAQ7kNvwHVdZu0&_nc_oc=AdnFoUJyilpopaDxCqjH2HRlQGZzO5h2M6aNarS30awMU2gP3Iw5ephj0RqUAIfRj2s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx5lzZGzxjZovOCla3Y2BxS7knDlTSDlOxO1E9GdtNFsg&oe=69B945D3"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TmExEAAHkewQ7kNvwHMYrwg&_nc_oc=AdknhCvVuwqw7tnIUp28c9s5LgOpfvFX-XnIwhnbOuWPjxiTP7tbmwtYmxvASXkY_04&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwhvgZEuCFtFV9D9fHgYUenryPwlPQF-NUhLpUvyInFzA&oe=69B9517B"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=w3G2VoAM3jAQ7kNvwESr7us&_nc_oc=AdkK3xhMn5eXd4aOJo6h-PGtVrQgz9XqDg-w4aWCLvxmYVtKXAdXM1vurZ7vWIIH6KM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxLH7xojNcL9-BO7TyHHCD3m0D3DLObXE-ThX4d6hRARw&oe=69B952CA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6-lnIoh9T1QQ7kNvwHVVi9n&_nc_oc=AdnaxK7-10z4r-658Enz-9W47-KBuk6Rh3el3kVQfFXffkflE9xLJyjUOoxLgA_Pq9I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy9J8i9UN6t7RuoHH9puNXqduIXHei1a8lWGyKOMX55zg&oe=69B93BFE"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Aerodrums", "supp